title: AskTechnician
---
<<declare $receivedCrowbar = false>>
<<declare $isHappy = false>>
<<declare $hasCokeCan = false>>
<<declare $lookedDrain = false>>
Fred: Hello, may I ask you something...
<<if $isHappy == true>>
    <<jump QuestionsHappy>>
<<else>>
    <<jump QuestionsAngry>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Angry
---
Technician: Ugh, people ALWAYS want me to help them!
Technician: Not anymore!
===



title: QuestionsHappy
---
Technician: Sure! what can I do for you?
-> Nothing, really.
    <<jump ByeHappy>>
-> Can you help me open a drain? <<if $lookedDrain == true and $receivedCrowbar == false>>
    <<jump Drain>>
===

title: QuestionsAngry
---
-> Nothing, really.
    <<jump ByeAngry>>
-> Can you help me open a drain? <<if $lookedDrain == true and $receivedCrowbar == false>>
    <<jump Angry>>
-> You look thirsty, do you want a cold Coke? <<if $hasCokeCan == true>>
    <<jump GiveCoke>>
===


title: ByeAngry
---
Technician: Bye.
===

title: ByeHappy
---
Technician: Bye, let me know if you need something
===


title: Drain
---
Technician: I can give you this crowbar.
Fred: Thanks, that could help. Bye!
<<set $receivedCrowbar to true>>
<<jump ByeHappy>>
===

title: GiveCoke
---
Technician: Hey thanks.
<<set $hasCokeCan to false>>
<<set $isHappy to true>>
Fred: you are welcome.
Technician: You're welcome. I'll continue with my work, but if you need anything, let me know. Bye!
===